    "%@ 的下次经期大约在": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的下次经期大约在"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@’s next period is expected around"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的下次經期大約在"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 的经期大约快到了，可以问问她需不需要什么。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的经期大约快到了，可以问问她需不需要什么。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@’s period may be coming up. You could ask if she needs anything."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的經期大約快到了，可以問問她需不需要什么。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2 小时后仍未记录已吃，会再提醒一次。试用到期后，已建吃药提醒照常响；新建或修改需要买断。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2 小时后仍未记录已吃，会再提醒一次。试用到期后，已建吃药提醒照常响；新建或修改需要买断。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you haven’t marked it taken after 2 hours, you’ll get one follow-up. Existing pill reminders continue after the trial. Creating or editing them requires the one-time purchase."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2 小時後仍未紀錄已吃，會再提醒一次。試用到期後，已建吃藥提醒照常響；新建或修改需要買斷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "21 天 + 7 天间隔": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "21 天 + 7 天间隔"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "21 days on, 7 days off"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "21 天 + 7 天間隔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "24 天 + 4 天间隔": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "24 天 + 4 天间隔"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "24 days on, 4 days off"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "24 天 + 4 天間隔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "28 天连续": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "28 天连续"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "28-day pack"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "28 天連續"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 备份未完成，本地记录已保留。你也可以导出备份文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 备份未完成，本地记录已保留。你也可以导出备份文件。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The iCloud backup could not finish. Your local records are safe. You can also export a backup file."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 備份未完成，本地紀錄已保留。你也可以匯出備份檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 空间有限，这次只备份了最近 5 年。本地记录完整保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 空间有限，这次只备份了最近 5 年。本地记录完整保留。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The iCloud limit was reached, so only the last 5 years were backed up. All local records are still on your phone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 空間有限，這次只備份了最近 5 年。本地紀錄完整保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 自动备份": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 自动备份"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic iCloud backup"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 自動備份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一个很干净的经期记录 App，不用注册、没有广告，数据只存在自己手机里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个很干净的经期记录 App，不用注册、没有广告，数据只存在自己手机里。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A simple period tracker with no account and no ads. Your records stay on your own phone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一個很干凈的經期紀錄 App，不用注冊、沒有廣告，資料只存在自己手機里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
